# Settings

- New setting: key and setter in `SettingsStore.kt`, wire it through `ui/settings/SettingsState.kt`,
  document it in `docs/settings.md` and `docs/data.md`. An Audio setting also touches
  `TtsController`, both screens and `SettingsOverlay.kt`.
- Tabs route by integer index and `else` means Layout/Font; update every `when` when adding a tab.
- Sub-tab bars go through `SettingsSubTabBar`. Tab icons are PNG silhouettes in `drawable-nodpi`.
- Never nest `verticalScroll` in the settings card. Editors are stacked `FlowFullscreenCard`s
  hosted by `SettingsOverlay`; confirmations use `FlowConfirmCard`.
- Use `FlowSettingsRows` components (slider, dropdown, toggle, choice chips) before building one.
- `EditableRuleList` serves five screens (Filters, Router, Parser, Queue lists); check all.
- Owners: `data/SettingsStore.kt` for keys; `data/ProgressWriter.kt` for positions.

Before changing a file here, run `rg -n '<FileName>' docs/agent/seams.md`.

Entries: `docs/agent/registry.md` (Settings overlay). Behavior: `docs/settings.md`. History:
`../flow-reader-chats/areas/settings.md`.
